done: #30 fix(run_chunk): deterministic per-replication seeding via .medsim_det_seed(), independent of chunk/worker/cluster-type/order — fixes SLURM chunk-collapse (coverage pinned at 1.0). #31 two-tier test infra: Tier-A CRAN guards + Tier-B Hopper suite (12,000 reps @ production scale: nominal coverage 0.947, narrow-interval 0.480, 12,000/12,000 distinct seeds, FORK-reproducible — all PASS), surfaced 5 more latent fixes. dev is CRAN-clean: R CMD check --as-cran 0/0/0 (real notes only — .remember/ note is a local-only artifact, absent on clean CI checkout), devtools::test() 968/0/1. #25 ADEMP coverage gates MERGED to dev 2026-06-22 (PR #26; coverage MCSE + failed-run logging + performance table + nsim helper + SE-vs-estimate plot; 913/0, CI green all platforms). Also fixed a pre-existing dev pkgdown failure (Sobol index gap from #22) + CLAUDE.md Remotes drift (medfit→medrobust). v0.3.1 RELEASED 2026-06-19.
